<section id="S6.SS7" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">6.7 </span>Mental QA</h3>

<figure id="S6.T11" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 11: </span>Mental QA Results: Average similarity scores for different language models across two prompt versions on the Mental QA task. The "Change" column represents the difference between Prompt 1 and Prompt 2. The underlined bold values are the best score for the specific column.</figcaption>
